Chart/Bytes: Bytes
Chart/Size: Storage size
Chart/StorageHint: Based on this log: smaller storage scores higher.
Chart/PrecisionHint: Timestamps and intervals retain times; daily counts and RLE retain dates.
Chart/ReadCostHint: Daily counts read directly; RLE expands runs; timestamps and intervals require per-event calculation.
Chart/ReadabilityHint: Timestamps and daily counts stand alone; runs and intervals need expansion or accumulation.
Calendar/Timed: Calendar: each check-in appears at its recorded time.
Calendar/AllDay: Calendar: daily check-in counts appear as all-day entries.
